{"id":1125,"level":80,"name":"Форсовані напади","group":"Форсування","format":27,"description":"<p>Attacks are a good weapon to force your opponent into making a specific move. For instance, by threatening to take an enemy piece that is stronger than your attacking piece,&nbsp;the opponent is forced to react.<br /><br />The same applies for unprotected enemy pieces. When you attack those, they&rsquo;ll usually need to move them away to another square.<br /><br /><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Win material with a forcing attack.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":97,"examples":[{"fen":"2kr2r1/ppp4p/2nbbn2/5p2/1P1P1Npq/P1N1P3/4B1PP/R1BQ1RK1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Gd6h2,Gh4h2,Rf4e6]} 1. g3 (1. Nxe6?   Qxh2+ 2. Kf2 Bg3#) 1... Qh6 2. Nxe6 1-0","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":39402,"fen":"r1bq1rk1/p3n1b1/1p5p/2pPp1p1/2P1Pp2/P1N2P2/4B1PP/1RBQ1RK1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. d6 Nc6 2. Qd5+ Rf7 3. Qxc6 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39389,"fen":"r2qkb1r/1p2ppp1/p1npb2p/3N4/4P1n1/4BN2/PPPQ1PPP/R3KB1R w - - 0 1","pgn":"1. Bb6 Qb8 2. Nc7+ Kd7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":50984,"fen":"4k3/pb3prp/5p1b/Pp2p3/4P2N/1B1P4/1P3K1P/4R3 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rb7,Re8,Rg7,Rh6]} 1. Nf5 Rg6 2. Nd6+ Kd7 3. Nxb7 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39330,"fen":"r1bq1rk1/1p1nbppp/p2p4/4p3/1Q2PPP1/2N1B2P/PPP3B1/R4RK1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... d5 2. Qb3 d4 3. Bxd4 exd4 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39328,"fen":"r2qk2r/3nnppp/p3p3/1p1pPb2/3Q3N/2N5/PPP1BPPP/2R1K2R b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... Nc6 2. Qf4 (2. Qe3 Qxh4) 2... g5 3. Qd2 gxh4 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39326,"fen":"r1b1k2r/pp1nqppp/3b4/4p3/2P1Q3/P2B1N2/1P3PPP/R1B2RK1 b kq - 0 1","pgn":"1... Nc5 2. Qe2 e4 (2... Nxd3 3. Qxd3 e4 4. Qe2 exf3) 3. Bc2 exf3 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[